<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia August gross wages rise 17.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia August gross wages rise 17.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES     Aug    July    Aug 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)    -0.4    +3.8    +1.6</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)     +17.2   +17.7   +19.3</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
